Description: Clixon controller Python API
 A network services API for the Clixon controller, which the controller
 talks NETCONF to over a UNIX socket.
 .
 The package ships the clixon Python module, clixon_server.py which runs
 the service modules of the controller, and clixon_rest.py which serves the
 services as a REST API.
